  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 9th level, battle butler may teleport as a move action to an unoccupied square adjacent to an ally so long as that ally is within 30 ft + 10 feet per battle butler level. He may do this at will, provided his service meter is between 10 and 7. The battle butler must have line of sight to the square.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/battle-butler#toc42\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
